WEBVTT

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.500
I'm leaving now.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.650
Off you go.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.240
Be safe.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.230
Hey.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:23.300
<i>The scenery this morning is like any other.</i>

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.750
<i>It's Rokudou-kun and Tamako-san.</i>

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:30.520
<i>I wonder what they're talking about.</i>

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.980
Target: Sakura

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.350
This candy makes you stop seeing spirits?

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.150
For me?

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:15.380
For you.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:17.360
For free, if you can believe it.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.020
It's been bothering me for a long time now.

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:22.740
Remember when you came to the afterlife?

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:34.000
Bekkou ame Candy

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.220
I want that candy.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.790
All right, I'll buy you one.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:28.310
Yay.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:34.000
<i>When Mamiya Sakura was a child, she was 
unthinkingly bought food from the afterlife.</i>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.130
<i>She's been able to see spirits 
ever since she ate it.</i>

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:39.880
But Grandma...

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:43.860
Please don't call me Grandma.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:44.280
Ow, ow.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.140
My temples, ow.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:49.480
Does it really work?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.200
Dunno.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.210
I mean, it's free.

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:57.190
It's a research prototype.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.920
There you have it, Mamiya Sakura.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.490
Don't get your hopes up.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.070
She's already eating it.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.490
She's not even listening.

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.660
Oh come on, Miho-chan.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.960
It's true, I swear.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:19.300
Kareido Shrine

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.300
There's a dried up well by this shrine.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:23.560
Normally the lid is sealed, 
but for some reason,

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:28.550
around this time each year, the lid 
breaks and something freaky happens.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:32.190
The A-1 Grand Prix?

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.260
It's starting soon again this year.

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.320
There was a notification

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:39.250
from the Shinigami Institute 
instructing us to crack down on them.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:40.950
It's that time of the year again, huh?

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:45.390
<i>The A-1 Grand Prix is an 
extremely unwelcome festival</i>

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:49.960
<i>where evil spirits compete against each 
other in cursing and haunting people.</i>

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:54.790
<i>Of course, the A in A-1 
stands for "Asmodeus."</i>

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:57.240
<i>This is going to be on your exam.</i>

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:02.000
There it is.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.800
The lid's closed, though.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.780
Huh?

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:09.810
The seal...

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:13.940
I'm scared!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.680
The lid moved by itself!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:22.820
Entry Number Four, Defeated Samurai.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.700
Why?!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.990
Are you all right, Mamiya Sakura?

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.300
<i>Sorry we abandoned you, Sakura-chan.</i>

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.650
Hey, Miho-chan.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.270
It's cool.

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:40.240
Yeah, the lid moving surprised me, though.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:42.730
Hey.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.520
Inside?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.930
There's nothing inside.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.870
You can't see me?

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:52.110
<i>Rokudou Rinne is physically a spirit when 
he's wearing his Haori of the Underworld,</i>

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:54.250
<i>thus making him invisible to normal people.</i>

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:00.580
More evil spirits from inside the well!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.640
Look, a 100 yen coin.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.960
Entry Number Thirteen, Boxer.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.220
Boxer Spirit.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.290
I'mma punch you!

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.770
I should take it to the police box.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:23.710
I'll give it to Rokudou-kun 
if the owner doesn't show up.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.600
Sakura-sama.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:31.830
Rinne-sama, what's gotten into Sakura-sama?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.380
It's the candy.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.440
It's definitely working.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.220
Sakura-sama's become an non-seer?

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.160
Yeah.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.780
She didn't even notice 
that intense evil aura.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:50.490
Okay, come on out of the well, now.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:57.750
It's the evil spirits competing 
in the A-1 Grand Prix.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.610
Here are the rules once again.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:04.460
The target of the hauntings

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:09.930
and curses is the first person to peek 
inside the well after its seal is broken.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.220
He's talking about Sakura-sama!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.920
Indeed, the target is the girl with pigtails.

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:22.400
Are you ready to curse her?!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.620
Yeah!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.440
Are you ready to haunt her?!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:29.820
Yeah!

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.160
Pass on!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.160
Uh oh, Shinigami.

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.740
Scram time!

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:53.690
What's this?

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:55.310
There's a letter tied to it.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.280
It's from Tamako-san.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.120
<i>Sakura-chan:</i>

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:04.570
<i>Here are more candies for 
when it stops working.</i>

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.510
When did she get here?

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:08.570
<i>Literally, just now.</i>

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:15.950
Speaking of which, I haven't seen 
any spirits since I ate that candy.

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:18.040
I wonder if it worked.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.210
Oh, my. Look at all of them.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.650
I can't get in!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.720
Why?

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:31.870
<i>That's because in Mamiya Sakura's house is 
a Exorcism Hourglass that cost 20,000 yen.</i>

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:35.730
<i>As long as she's inside, she's safe.</i>

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:40.760
Sakura-chan is the A-1 Grand Prix target?

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.840
No wonder.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.970
Are you seriously going to try to take down

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:48.400
all the competing evil 
spirits by school tomorrow?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.080
There are about 5,000 competitors.

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.010
5,000 spirits...

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:58.680
Morning.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.410
Morning, Sakura-chan.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.910
Such a nice morning.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.460
<i>What's this ominous air?</i>

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.020
<i>I can sense spirits approaching.</i>

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.920
<i>Lots of them.</i>

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:14.050
Morning, Tsubasa-kun.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.930
Look out, Mamiya-san!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.100
Holy Ash! Run!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.520
What the hell are you doing?!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.180
Are you okay, Mamiya-san?

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:26.980
Are you hurt?

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.370
Was there something there?

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:36.710
It's so nice being normal, 
not being able to see anything!

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.250
Mamiya Sakura.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:49.420
Sakura-sama still can't see them, huh?

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.900
Rokudou, what's going on here?

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.320
You better have an explanation.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:55.210
Mamiya Sakura's being targeted.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.010
What?

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:00.490
<i>I've been preoccupied fighting 
spirits since yesterday.</i>

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:03.450
<i>I haven't even had a chance 
to explain to Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.020
<i>But there's no time to waste.</i>

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.580
Mamiya Sakura, we need to talk.

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:12.670
Sakura-chan took Rika-chan 
to the nurse's office.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.520
Apparently, she's not feeling too well.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.110
Sorry, Sakura-chan.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:20.640
My head's feeling really heavy.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.910
I wonder what caused it so suddenly.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.560
Entry Number 42: Sumo Wrestler Spirit.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.420
Thrust down!

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:32.310
Huh?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.550
My head's feeling better.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.010
Really?

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:39.630
That was a close one.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:42.720
That's good.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:47.270
Hooah! Hooah! Hooah!

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.740
Let's go back.

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.820
I wonder what that was.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.400
Rokudou Rinne.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.780
Rokudou's absent.

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:58.910
<i>Oh, yeah. I haven't seen 
Rokudou-kun since yesterday.</i>

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.600
<i>I wonder if he's busy.</i>

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:02.800
Do you give up?!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:11.280
<i>He could work himself to death saving 
Mamiya-san, and she'd never take notice.</i>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.300
<i>I pity you, Rokudou.</i>

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:24.060
<i>I need to let Mamiya Sakura 
know she's in danger.</i>

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.350
Notice me!

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:31.860
What's this?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:36.620
Pan... ger?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:38.870
Is it a code?

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.840
It's a D!

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:54.440
Hey, Sakura-chan, Rokudou-kun's 
absent again, huh?

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:55.940
I wonder what's wrong with him.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.090
I dunno.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.840
He's kinda weird, huh?

00:10:58.840 --> 00:10:59.970
Like his track suit.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.470
Yeah.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:08.190
<i>I wonder, why does my chest feel heavy?</i>

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:09.390
<i>I feel weird.</i>

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.970
Sakura-chan, we should burn off our lunch.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.840
Let's get some exercise.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:14.890
Diet.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.270
Okay.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:18.320
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.290
<i>I guess I overate.</i>

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.250
Here.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:24.950
Got it.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.760
They're playing volleyball on the rooftop.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.330
This can't be good.

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:30.670
There.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.830
Got it.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:33.830
Got it.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.960
She's going to fall!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.720
Be careful, Mamiya Sakura.

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:43.000
Hup!

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:44.970
Woohoo!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:49.220
Ow.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:51.390
What is it, Sakura-chan?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:54.730
I felt my hair get pulled out.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.940
I pulled it out just now.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.220
Mamiya Sakura's hair?

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.940
What's that for, Grandma?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.760
Please don't call me Grandma.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.700
Ow, ow, my temples!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.200
Here, use this.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.100
It's...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:14.960
A Decoy Doll.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:27.100
A Decoy Doll

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:21.900
<i>A Decoy Doll is a Shinigami tool that 
creates a powerful attractive force</i>

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:27.100
<i>on any evil spirit targeting whomever's 
nail or hair is put within.</i>

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:31.600
It's a super high-quality item. 
It costs a whopping 30,000 yen,

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.660
but it's on me this time.

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:35.980
Grandma!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:39.320
Ow, ow, ow!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:45.950
On top of that, any evil spirit that 
touches it becomes unable to move.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:50.240
I can take them all out in one swoop.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:03.940
Peas in a pod.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:07.720
No wonder it's worth 30,000 yen, huh?

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.100
<i>Something's just not right.</i>

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:20.920
<i>I don't feel anything, but it 
seems like something's happening.</i>

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.230
There she is.

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.160
Target acquired.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.910
Curse you!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:30.910
Now!

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.370
Look out, Mamiya-san!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.250
Thank goodness.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.640
You bastard!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.570
That's a doll!

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:44.690
What?!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:51.260
It's— It's a full-scale figure?!

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.430
You pervert!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:58.330
You made a Mamiya-san figure so you can 
keep her by your side all the time?!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.100
Dude.

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.260
Huh?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:02.440
What are you doing, Jumonji-kun?

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:11.410
A full-scale Sakura-chan figure!

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.290
No!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.200
It's Rokudou-kun's!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.960
What about Rokudou-kun, Tsubasa-kun?

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.370
The figure stood up!

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.040
I'm so scared!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.610
Don't let her get away!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.760
Rokudou-kun, are you there?

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.330
Stop!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.530
Curse you!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.080
Amazing.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:45.320
The spirits are abandoning the real 
Sakura-san. They're coming after us.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.780
It's super effective!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:54.390
<i>I just hope they don't think 
I'm a creepy guy who made</i>

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.370
<i>a full-scale Mamiya Sakura figure.</i>

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:59.650
Rokudou-kun made a full-scale 
Sakura-chan figure?!

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:01.630
He's one of those people?!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.490
No wonder I haven't seen him lately.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:06.610
So that's what he's been doing.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.010
<i>They totally think he did.</i>

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:18.770
<i>I didn't see Rokudou-kun at all today.</i>

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.600
<i>I wonder what he's up to.</i>

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.280
Wh-What the...

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.370
A Decoy Doll!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:27.900
I can't move!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.400
Quit resisting and rest in peace!

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:36.910
It works so well.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:43.780
<i>User beware: the Decoy Doll becomes a 
normal doll after three hours of use.</i>

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:51.010
It cost 30,000 yen and it 
only works for three hours?!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:54.570
10,000 yen per hour?!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.770
It really is high quality.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:00.350
Rinne, good work.

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:02.020
Grandma.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.220
Please don't call me Grandma.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:08.820
Ow, ow, ow.

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:15.740
Thanks to you, almost all the evil spirits 
in the A-1 Grand Prix were purified.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:21.150
It's kind of thankless, though, huh?

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:22.210
How so?

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:27.960
I mean, you're working so hard to protect 
Sakura-sama from the evil spirits.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.800
Oh, right.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.680
Sakura-chan can't see it at 
all because of the candy.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.040
That's gotta suck.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.030
Right?

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:43.060
I'm just doing my job as a Shinigami.

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:47.690
Whether Mamiya Sakura can see 
me or not, it doesn't matter.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.180
Hey, it's Sakura-chan.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.040
Oh yeah.

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.360
She's looking this way.

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.370
<i>She can see me again?</i>

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.240
Grand...

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:10.130
Bar... gain.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:14.260
Grand Bargain

00:17:10.370 --> 00:17:12.280
I guess she's not back to normal yet.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.130
I see.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:25.730
This candy's still keeping 
me from seeing spirits.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:31.230
<i>How long is it going to last anyway?</i>

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:37.780
<i>No, maybe Mamiya Sakura would be happier 
not being able to see any spirits.</i>

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.240
Sakura, the bath's ready.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.740
Go bathe.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:44.230
Okay.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.510
<i>Thump thump, thump thump.</i>

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:49.210
Holy crap.

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.500
Rinne-sama, Rinne-sama.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.770
I swear, I won't tell anyone.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:56.960
That you took advantage of 
the fact that Sakura-sama

00:17:56.960 --> 00:17:58.630
can't see you to watch her change.

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:01.570
<i>Thank God she couldn't see me.</i>

00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:05.670
I feel good.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.250
I wonder how long it's going to last.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.900
Rokudou's absent again?

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:19.880
<i>I wonder if he's not here.</i>

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:22.570
<i>Or is he actually here?</i>

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:25.410
<i>I wonder what he's up to right now.</i>

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:27.520
Curse upon you!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.120
Not a chance!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.130
I'll haunt you!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.130
Fire Wheel Fissioning!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:42.610
A-1 Grand Prix!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.100
Mrowwwwrr

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.700
How many does that make?

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:54.360
We'll have to count the tag bibs.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:59.140
What a pain.

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.240
There now, don't say that.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:06.490
You get 5 yen for each bib you hand in.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:07.660
5 yen?!

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:11.830
There's 5,000 evil spirits competing, right?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.750
I— I make 25,000 yen?

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.370
Don't be silly.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:20.550
Sakura-chan's Decoy Doll cost 30,000 yen.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.200
That's a net loss of 5,000 yen.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.380
I'll go hand this in.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:30.270
You said it was on you, and now 
you're just working us for free.

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:37.000
Rokudou-kun.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.030
Are you home?

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:39.960
Are you not?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.290
This is kind of lame.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.550
Oh my, hang on.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:07.680
Pummel all Damashigami on sight.

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:07.680
Please do not delay submitting expense claims.

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.830
This isn't quite enough.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.680
You handed in 4,999 tab bibs.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:08.780
Oh.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:11.810
Then I wonder if there's 
another evil spirit left over.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.460
Entry Number 510.

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.660
Burglar's spirit.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:18.190
Here I go.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.820
I didn't get all of them?

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.540
I'll curse you.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.530
I'll haunt you.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:29.580
I'm not losing in the A-1 
Grand Prix this year.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:31.990
Mamiya Sakura!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.450
It's not safe there!

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.830
I'm winning this year!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.360
Yes!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.630
Good job, Mamiya Sakura!

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:44.050
Are you okay, Mamiya Sakura?

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:47.580
I'm leaving.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.810
I'm— I'm so lonely.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:04.490
I forgot about these.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:06.610
Ow.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.690
Huh?

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:15.090
Rokudou-kun?

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:18.680
Mamiya Sakura.

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:26.260
Were you out of town?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:27.510
No.

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:31.140
<i>I've actually been by you more than usual.</i>

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:37.380
Tamako-san gave me all these candies 
that stop me from seeing spirits.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.520
Can you give them back?

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.070
You're done with them?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.700
Rokudou-kun, here.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:53.610
I made you lunch.

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:55.180
L-Lunch?

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:57.710
You worked for free this time, right?

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:00.710
It's a treasure box!

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:03.750
I burnt the eggs a little.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:08.090
So the candy works for three days, huh?

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:08.840
Yeah.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.550
I wish I saw the A-1 Grand Prix.

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:18.440
Oh yeah, the spirits are holding 
the Y-1 Grand Prix soon.

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:19.940
I'm so done.

00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:26.030
Yum.

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:05.090
It's a request letter.

00:24:05.090 --> 00:24:06.600
Who's it from?

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.090
NHK?

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:13.050
I miss the Taiga Dramas that I used 
to watch when Grandpa was still alive.

00:24:13.050 --> 00:24:14.820
You don't even have a TV.

00:24:14.820 --> 00:24:16.640
You're right, Rokumon.

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:20.480
What does the request say?

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:24.480
Season 2
 Coming Spring 2016!

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:26.480
Wow...
